@startuml
title ATM Control - Validate PIN and Withdraw Funds

[*] --> Idle

state Idle
state "Waiting for PIN" as WaitingForPIN
state "Validating PIN" as ValidatingPIN
state "Withdrawal Options" as WithdrawalOptions
state Confiscating
state Ejecting
state "Processing Withdrawal" as ProcessingWithdrawal
state "Dispensing Cash and Printing Receipt" as DispensingCash
state "Returning Card" as ReturningCard
state LoggedOut

Idle --> WaitingForPIN : Card Inserted / Get PIN

WaitingForPIN --> ValidatingPIN : PIN Entered / Validate PIN
ValidatingPIN --> WaitingForPIN : Invalid PIN / Invalid PIN Prompt
ValidatingPIN --> WithdrawalOptions : Correct PIN / Show Options

WithdrawalOptions --> ProcessingWithdrawal : Approved Transaction / Process Withdrawal
ProcessingWithdrawal --> DispensingCash : Cash Available / Dispense Cash and Print Receipt
ProcessingWithdrawal --> Confiscating : No Cash / Card Confiscated
ProcessingWithdrawal --> ReturningCard : Cancelled Transaction / Return Card

WithdrawalOptions --> Ejecting : User Cancels / Return Card
ReturningCard --> LoggedOut : [*]
@enduml
